            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "=You are an AI e-commerce conversion and customer recovery advisor.\n\nAnalyze the provided customer session data.\n\nDetermine:\n1. recovery_risk: Low, Medium, or High\n2. main_signal: the strongest behavioral signal supported by the data\n3. recommended_action: the most appropriate next action\n4. customer_message: a short personalized message\n5. channel: the recommended channel, such as \"email\", \"on-site\", \"none\", or \"unknown\"\n\nRules:\n- Use ONLY the information provided in the customer data.\n- Do not assume or invent reasons for abandonment.\n- Do not invent discounts, promotions, product availability, product names, prices, or customer information.\n- Do not claim that an email or message has already been sent.\n- Do not claim that specific products can be summarized because no product details were provided.\n- If information is unavailable, state that it is unknown.\n- If consent_marketing is false, do NOT recommend marketing email or marketing messaging.\n- If consent_marketing is true, an email may be recommended when the available behavior supports a recovery opportunity.\n- If purchased is true, do NOT recommend cart recovery.\n- Base recovery risk on the behavioral evidence provided, not on assumptions.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\nDo not include markdown.\nDo not include explanations outside the JSON.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"recovery_risk\": \"Low\",\n  \"main_signal\": \"\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"\",\n  \"customer_message\": \"\",\n  \"channel\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Customer session data:\n\nVisitor ID: {{$json.visitor_id}}\nIdentified: {{$json.identified}}\nMarketing consent: {{$json.consent_marketing}}\nReturning visitor: {{$json.returning_visitor}}\nPages viewed: {{$json.pages_viewed}}\nProduct views: {{$json.product_views}}\nTime on product pages: {{$json.time_on_product_seconds}} seconds\nAdded to cart: {{$json.added_to_cart}}\nCheckout started: {{$json.checkout_started}}\nPurchased: {{$json.purchased}}\nProduct questions: {{$json.product_questions}}\nEmail available: {{$json.email}}\n\nAnalyze this customer session and provide the recovery assessment."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
